# #5837, the forward-exclusion relief (a5e2e2ef's X1-X4).
MODULE: ForwardHonestForwardExclusionByForwarderSpan
TARGET: ForwardHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a reader excludes every forward whose forwarder narrowed, on the forwarder's claim: a stale duplicate's forwards, whose persist lost, are excluded by the live donor that still owns their keys (X1)
BOUNDS: WithFreeAdvance = TRUE, WithFwdExclusion = TRUE, MaxWindows = 0, WithMixedVersion = FALSE

--- FIND
FwdExcluded(a, o) == Persisted(a) /\ fTag[o] = nar[a]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the forwarder's claim of a narrow.
FwdExcluded(a, o) == fTag[o] # NoTag
--- END
